input-event-daemon (statically linked)
======================================

Handles power-key events: short press to suspend, long press to shutdown.

Prebuilt from Rockchip Buildroot 2021 SDK:
78e74bf5127 input-event-daemon: Ignore BTN_TOUCH

Using rockchip_rk3036_defconfig with additional configs:
BR2_GCC_VERSION_11_X=y

BR2_PACKAGE_INPUT_EVENT_DAEMON=y
BR2_PACKAGE_INPUT_EVENT_DAEMON_POWER_KEY=y
BR2_PACKAGE_INPUT_EVENT_DAEMON_STATIC=y
